From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 04:04:30 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] virt: gunyah: build the Gunyah vCPU timer as
 gunyah_timer.ko

arch/arm64/gunyah/timer.c was built as timer.ko, a module name that says
nothing and could clash with any other "timer" module. Name the module
gunyah_timer (same source file, no code change), as the other Gunyah
modules. The users resolve it through the module dependencies
(gunyah.ko and gunyah_vcpu.ko use its exports), so modprobe pulls it in
under the new name; iceland-gvm loads either name.

Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/gunyah/Makefile | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/gunyah/Makefile b/arch/arm64/gunyah/Makefile
index e3a4052b4a12..1a1725268b1e 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/gunyah/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/gunyah/Makefile
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
 
 obj-$(CONFIG_GUNYAH_HYPERCALLS) += gunyah_hypercall.o
-obj-$(CONFIG_GUNYAH_TIMER) += timer.o
+obj-$(CONFIG_GUNYAH_TIMER) += gunyah_timer.o
+gunyah_timer-y := timer.o
